            "title": "1740W Power Take Off Socket",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>1740W power take-off socket synchronises the operation of the vacuum cleaner and power tool together to allow you to extract dust as you sand or drill. Plug in a power tool and connect the suction hose to the dust extraction port on the tool. The vacuum cleaner will automatically turn on remotely when the power tool is turned on and off accordingly.</p>",
