            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Bagged or Bagless",
            "text": "<p>This wet & dry vacuum cleaner can be used with or without a dust bag. Use the included dust bag for easy and more hygienic disposal of dry dust and dirt. For larger rubble you can collect debris directly into the collection tank. For wet suction, do not use a dust bag.</p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "card_JzGNHM": {
