          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Vacmaster_Wet_and_Dry_with_Long_Working_Reach.webp",
            "image_loading": "",
            "title": "Long Working Reach",
            "text": "<p>The 2.5m flexible suction hose, 3x friction fit extension wands and a 4m power cord allows the Vacmaster Multi 20 PTO to have a working reach of approx. 7.5m. Ideal for cleaning the car, blowing leaves or working outdoors.</p>",
            "url": ""
          }
        },
